          -s the optimum shift up with depth" comparison the campaign was designed for has **no data**. Provenance: MEASURED single point; the shape claim would be INFERRED with n=1 → withheld.
       79 +### (b) Depth 64k→128k (budget 2048) — lost-in-the-middle? **No degradation.** (MEASURED)
       80 +TS% **28 → 30 (Δ+2)** and the **reuse** objective — the deliberate lost-in-the-middle sensor (find the
       81 +planted util placed *deepest* in context) — held **1.00 → 1.00**. **INFERRED:** the shared-prefix corpus
       82 ++ the model's retrieval hold up to 128k on this eval; the small TS uptick is within run-to-run noise
       83 +(REPS=2), so read as "flat, not worse." No retrieval collapse was observed — contrary to the hypothesis
       84 +that reuse would sag at depth.
