       66 -- **⚠ GTT SPILL — `un-d128-f16-rb2048`, peak GTT 2053 MiB** (MEASURED; idle baseline ~77 MiB). At 128k with **KV-f16** the working set exceeded VRAM and spilled ~2 GB into GPU-accessible system RAM — the **freeze-risk** condition
          -the skill says to flag. Peak VRAM 30187 MiB also sits within ~2.4 GB of the 32624 MiB physical ceiling. **Consequence for practice (INFERRED):** do **not** deploy 27B at 128k on KV-f16 on this box; the missing **q8_0** A/B (questi
          -on c) is the direct mitigation to test — halving KV VRAM should pull the working set back under the ceiling.
