      144 +## Consequences & root causes (ultrathink)
      145 +
      146 +1. **The bottleneck is strict discipline, not reasoning.** (MEASURED judge ~4/5 + `fails:` lists;
      147 +   INFERRED synthesis) 0/120 hard-passes with high design scores means the 27B *solves* these tasks but
      148 +   can't emit strict-clean `tsc`+`eslint` code with edge-complete tests one-shot. **Therefore:** for
      149 +   agentic TS work, pair the 27B with a lint/type auto-fix loop rather than expecting one-shot clean code.
      150 +2. **More thinking is not free capability at depth.** (MEASURED, finding a) Budget 4096 *helps* at 64k
      151 +   (+7 pts over 1024) but *hurts* at 128k (26% vs 30% at 2048). **Therefore:** cap budget at 2048 for
      152 +   128k serving; reserve 4096 for shallower prompts.
      153 +3. **q8_0 is the depth-deployment win.** (MEASURED, finding c) −2.3% quality for −4421 MiB and materially
      154 +   lower ceiling pressure. The only cost is ~20% decode. **Therefore:** default 128k serving to q8_0.
      155 +4. **GTT spill is universal here and must be watched.** (MEASURED health) Every cell spilled >500 MiB to
      156 +   host RAM. **INFERRED:** the frozen C1 substrate at 64–128k on a 32 GB card is genuinely at the edge;
      157 +   q8_0 helps but does not eliminate spill. **Therefore:** monitor GTT in production and prefer q8_0 at 128k.
      158 +5. **No lost-in-the-middle on reuse (this eval).** (MEASURED, finding b) reuse 1.00→1.00 — the prefix-cached
      159 +   corpus + deepest-placed util is retrieved reliably to 128k. **OPEN:** whether a harder retrieval
      160 +   placement (multiple distractor utils, non-prefix layout) would break this is untested.
      161 +
      162 +## Recommended config (for the local 27B on deep agentic TS)
      163 +
      164 +```
      165 +# unsloth-MTP build, frozen C1 substrate, deployed at 128k with q8_0 KV:
      166 +llama-server -m Qwen3.6-27B-MTP-Q4_K_M.gguf \
      167 +  -ub 2048 -b 4096 -fa on --spec-type draft-mtp \
      168 +  --cache-type-k q8_0 --cache-type-v q8_0 \
      169 +  --reasoning-budget 2048 \
      170 +  --temp 0.6 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20 --min-p 0
      171 +# 64k-only work that fits headroom: --reasoning-budget 4096, KV f16 (peak 33% TS)
      172 +```
      173 +Caveat: this is the **best-of-a-weak-field** local config — expect ~28–33% strict TS one-shot and pair it
      174 +with a type/lint fix loop. Watch GTT; keep peak VRAM off the 32624 MiB ceiling.
      175 +
      176 +## Methodology & caveats
      177 +
      178 +- **Fixtures:** 6 discriminating tasks (`lru-cache`, `rate-limiter`, `store-remove`, `deep-equal` = Sonnet-tier;
      179 +  `async-memo`, `expr-eval` = Opus-tier), each assembled at the cell's depth by `build_context.py` with the
      180 +  reuse-target placed deepest; corpus = shared cached prefix (only the first task per server pays deep prefill).
      181 +- **Grading:** `score_typescript.py batch` runs the real toolchain (`tsc` strict + `eslint` strict + candidate
      182 +  `vitest` + hidden edge `vitest`); `hard_pass` = all gate objectives (types+lint+tests+reuse+edge) = 1.0.
      183 +- **Judge:** `judge.py` blind, one opus session fanning out per-batch subagents; scores design/clarity/robustness.
      184 +- **Sampling fixed** (not swept): temp 0.6 · top_p 0.95 · top_k 20 · min_p 0 (Qwen3.6-thinking recommended).
      185 +- **REPS=2** (engine-bench standard) — treat ±1 task / small TS deltas (e.g. finding b's Δ+2) as within noise.
      186 +- **Held fixed:** C1 substrate (Vulkan b9950, `-ub 2048 -b 4096 -fa on`, MTP-on, prefix cache). One variable per comparison.
      187 +- **Failures/runaways:** none this campaign (fails 0, runaway 0%). **GTT spill in all cells** — see HEALTH.
      188 +- **All quality/latency/memory numbers are MEASURED** from `out/summary.md` + `charts/appendix.md` (deterministic
      189 +  Python aggregation; the per-reply jsonl was not read into this write-up). Reference tiers are `MEASURED`
      190 +  calibration one-shots on a different SUT — kept in a separate column, never blended.
      191 +
