      113 -## Recommended config (with the standing caveat)
      114 -
      115 -At the one operating point measured, the deploy-usable setting is the frozen substrate below — but **not at 128k on KV-f16**, which spilled to GTT. Treat this as provisional until the q8_0 A/B (question c) confirms the memory fix:
      116 -
      117 -```
      118 -# substrate (C1, frozen): llama.cpp Vulkan b9950
      119 -llama-server -m Qwen3.6-27B-MTP-Q4_K_M.gguf \
      120 -  -ub 2048 -b 4096 -fa on --spec-type draft-mtp \
      121 -  --reasoning-budget 2048 \
      122 -  -c 131072 -ctk f16 -ctv f16     # ⚠ 128k+f16 spilled 2053 MiB to GTT here — test -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0
      123 -```
